# Never let git rewrite line endings in these files — pdf.js ships a
# minified worker file that must stay byte-identical to what pdfjs-dist
# publishes. A previous autocrlf conversion corrupted it (CRLF injected
# into a minified single-line-ish file), which broke PDF rendering for
# some Major Acts. Treat these as binary/untouched:
public/pdfjs/*.mjs -text -diff
*.pdf -text -diff binary
